HCLASS - original Mordor class guide

Syntax: hclass [class-name]
        hclass progress

With no argument, shows guidance for your current class. Supply assassin,
barbarian, cleric, fighter, mage, paladin, ranger, thief, bard, or monk to
read that class's guide. This command does not change your class or stats.

Train in the proper class training room after earning enough experience
and gold. The original engine controls abilities and progression.

Hclass progress shows your actual XP requirement, training gold cost, and
remaining XP and gold. It also checks whether this room trains your class,
whether blindness blocks training, and whether the engine has approved your
character for training. Requirements come from the original engine's level
table. Higher levels use its original extended-level calculation.

When every requirement is met, use train to advance one level. Training
spends gold and retains your accumulated XP. This guide only reads your
character; it does not train you, grant XP, spend gold, or change any flags.
